# Every shortcut and Telegram command in one list. Runs on the phone - no passphrase.
cat <<'LIST'
XRPL bots - your commands

On this phone (Termux):
  xrplstatus      Testnet bots: running? trades, wins, profit today
  xrplpaper       Today's mainnet paper trading (no XRP spent)
  xrplhealth      Server CPU, memory and disk
  xrpldashboard   Open the private dashboard + Live page in Chrome
                  (type close in Termux when you're done)
  xrplstart       Start the Testnet bots
  xrplstop        Stop the Testnet bots (normal stop, not the kill switch)
  xrplcommands    This list

On Telegram (send to your bot):
  /status         Testnet bots: running or stopped, balances
  /paper          Today's mainnet paper trading
  /health         Server CPU, memory and disk
  /kill PIN       KILL SWITCH: stop all bots, sell tokens for XRP
  /resume PIN     Start the bots again
  /commands       This list

Mainnet trading is OFF. Never share your PIN, passphrase or keys.
LIST
read -n 1 -s -r -p "Tap any key to close"
